# New Forever dungeon. Source: foreverchanges.pro/dungeons/shapers-terrace (level range is Blizzard's). The page lists
# 3 Horde quests, takeable from level 55, without their givers.
@dungeon Shaper's Terrace
@levels 58-60
@window 56-60
@best 58
@hub Un'Goro Crater, 45.0, 8.0, 10
@hub Orgrimmar, 50.0, 50.0
@hub Undercity, 66.0, 44.0
@entrance none
RUN | New Forever dungeon, not checked in game yet. It is in the hills of Un'Goro Crater. It has 3 Horde quests (from level 55), but who gives them is not published yet: ask around Marshal's Refuge and take what is offered; the addon logs it so these steps can be filled in.
